# SYNTHETIC - hand-made drm-harness records for scripts/harness-summary.py --self-test.
# NOT measurements from a real board: never quote these numbers as evidence.
# A refused scenario run: `revoke` needs the kernel-lease source, so the
# harness stopped before opening any device. There is no `session` record, so
# the source comes from the harness args and every measurement is `not measured`.
harness version=0.1.0 scenario=revoke args="--source master --frames 60 revoke"
error scenario=revoke message="revoke needs --source kernel-lease: this process must be the lessor"
VERDICT revoke FAIL revoke needs --source kernel-lease: this process must be the lessor
